{"id":"972a3399e2a4e671","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/762_Guarded_TGDs.md","title":"762 Guarded TGDs","display":"762_Guarded_TGDs","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"762-Guarded-TGDs\">762 Guarded TGDs</h1>\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(N_P,\\operatorname{ar},N_C,N_N)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma=(N_P,\\operatorname{ar},N_C,N_N)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_P\">\\(N_P\\)</span> 是谓词名集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}:N_P\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}:N_P\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_C\">\\(N_C\\)</span> 是常元集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_N=\\{\\nu_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(N_N=\\{\\nu_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span> 是空值集合。变量集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Var}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Var}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>构造子为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom},\\operatorname{conj},\\operatorname{gtgd}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom},\\operatorname{conj},\\operatorname{gtgd}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其型别为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}:\\{(P,\\tau):P\\in N_P,\\ \\tau:\\operatorname{ar}(P)\\to\\mathsf{Term}\\}\\to\\mathsf{Atom},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom}:\\{(P,\\tau):P\\in N_P,\\ \\tau:\\operatorname{ar}(P)\\to\\mathsf{Term}\\}\\to\\mathsf{Atom},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{conj}:\\mathsf{Atom}^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathsf{Conj}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{conj}:\\mathsf{Atom}^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathsf{Conj}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-项、原子与合取\">2. 项、原子与合取</h1>\n<p>项集合与闭项集合为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Term}=N_C\\cup N_N\\cup\\mathsf{Var},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{GTerm}=N_C\\cup N_N.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Term}=N_C\\cup N_N\\cup\\mathsf{Var},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{GTerm}=N_C\\cup N_N.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原子集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Atom}\">\\(\\mathsf{Atom}\\)</span> 是满足下列条款的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in N_P\">\\(P\\in N_P\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}(P)=n\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}(P)=n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau:n\\to\\mathsf{Term}\">\\(\\tau:n\\to\\mathsf{Term}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P(\\tau)\\in\\mathsf{Atom}\">\\(P(\\tau)\\in\\mathsf{Atom}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>闭原子集合定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{GAtom}=\\{P(\\tau)\\in\\mathsf{Atom}:\\operatorname{rng}(\\tau)\\subseteq\\mathsf{GTerm}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{GAtom}=\\{P(\\tau)\\in\\mathsf{Atom}:\\operatorname{rng}(\\tau)\\subseteq\\mathsf{GTerm}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>合取体为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Conj}=\\mathsf{Atom}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\mathsf{Conj}=\\mathsf{Atom}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(P(\\tau))=\\operatorname{rng}(\\tau)\\cap\\mathsf{Var},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}(A_0,\\ldots,A_{k-1})=\\bigcup_{i&lt;k}\\operatorname{FV}(A_i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(P(\\tau))=\\operatorname{rng}(\\tau)\\cap\\mathsf{Var},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}(A_0,\\ldots,A_{k-1})=\\bigcup_{i&lt;k}\\operatorname{FV}(A_i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"3.-Guarded-TGD\">3. Guarded TGD</h1>\n<p>TGD 是对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\beta,\\eta)\">\\((\\beta,\\eta)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta,\\eta\\in\\mathsf{Conj}\">\\(\\beta,\\eta\\in\\mathsf{Conj}\\)</span>。定义保护原子谓词</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Guard}(A,\\beta)\\Longleftrightarrow A\\in\\operatorname{rng}(\\beta)\\ \\wedge\\ \\operatorname{FV}(\\beta)\\subseteq\\operatorname{FV}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Guard}(A,\\beta)\\Longleftrightarrow A\\in\\operatorname{rng}(\\beta)\\ \\wedge\\ \\operatorname{FV}(\\beta)\\subseteq\\operatorname{FV}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义受保护合取对的子类型</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{GuardPair}=\n\\{(\\beta,\\eta):\\beta,\\eta\\in\\mathsf{Conj},\\exists A\\in\\operatorname{rng}(\\beta)\\operatorname{Guard}(A,\\beta)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{GuardPair}=\n\\{(\\beta,\\eta):\\beta,\\eta\\in\\mathsf{Conj},\\exists A\\in\\operatorname{rng}(\\beta)\\operatorname{Guard}(A,\\beta)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>Guarded TGD 集合及其构造子定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{GTGD}=\\mathsf{GuardPair},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{GTGD}=\\mathsf{GuardPair},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{gtgd}:\\mathsf{GuardPair}\\to\\mathsf{GTGD},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{gtgd}(\\beta,\\eta)=(\\beta,\\eta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{gtgd}:\\mathsf{GuardPair}\\to\\mathsf{GTGD},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{gtgd}(\\beta,\\eta)=(\\beta,\\eta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此，若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\beta,\\eta)\\notin\\mathsf{GuardPair}\">\\((\\beta,\\eta)\\notin\\mathsf{GuardPair}\\)</span>，则\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{gtgd}(\\beta,\\eta)\">\\(\\operatorname{gtgd}(\\beta,\\eta)\\)</span> 未定义，不能形成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{GTGD}\">\\(\\mathsf{GTGD}\\)</span> 的元素。</p>\n<p>程序为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi=(\\Sigma,\\mathcal G)\">\\(\\Pi=(\\Sigma,\\mathcal G)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal G\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathsf{GTGD}\">\\(\\mathcal G\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathsf{GTGD}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-替换\">4. 替换</h1>\n<p>定义新变量函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{freshVar}(X)=x_m,\n\\qquad\nm=\\min\\{i:x_i\\notin X\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{freshVar}(X)=x_m,\n\\qquad\nm=\\min\\{i:x_i\\notin X\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span> 有限。对 guarded TGD 定义绑定变量集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{G}(\\beta,\\eta)=\\operatorname{FV}(\\eta)\\setminus\\operatorname{FV}(\\beta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{G}(\\beta,\\eta)=\\operatorname{FV}(\\eta)\\setminus\\operatorname{FV}(\\beta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>有限支撑双射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(\\rho:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span> 固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_C\\cup N_N\">\\(N_C\\cup N_N\\)</span>，并逐构造子扩张为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\rho(c)=c\\ (c\\in N_C),\\qquad\n\\widehat\\rho(\\nu)=\\nu\\ (\\nu\\in N_N),\\qquad\n\\widehat\\rho(x)=\\rho(x)\\ (x\\in\\mathsf{Var}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\rho(c)=c\\ (c\\in N_C),\\qquad\n\\widehat\\rho(\\nu)=\\nu\\ (\\nu\\in N_N),\\qquad\n\\widehat\\rho(x)=\\rho(x)\\ (x\\in\\mathsf{Var}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\rho(P(\\tau))=P(\\tau&#39;),\n\\qquad \\tau&#39;(i)=\\widehat\\rho(\\tau(i))\\quad(i&lt;\\operatorname{ar}(P)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\rho(P(\\tau))=P(\\tau&#39;),\n\\qquad \\tau&#39;(i)=\\widehat\\rho(\\tau(i))\\quad(i&lt;\\operatorname{ar}(P)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\rho(A_0,\\ldots,A_{k-1})=(\\rho(A_0),\\ldots,\\rho(A_{k-1})),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\rho(A_0,\\ldots,A_{k-1})=(\\rho(A_0),\\ldots,\\rho(A_{k-1})),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\rho(\\beta,\\eta)=(\\rho(\\beta),\\rho(\\eta)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\rho(\\beta,\\eta)=(\\rho(\\beta),\\rho(\\eta)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span> 是双射，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Guard}(A,\\beta)\">\\(\\operatorname{Guard}(A,\\beta)\\)</span> 当且仅当\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Guard}(\\rho(A),\\rho(\\beta))\">\\(\\operatorname{Guard}(\\rho(A),\\rho(\\beta))\\)</span>。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"X\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\operatorname{GTGD}}Y\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\rho\\ \\bigl(Y=\\rho(X)\\bigr),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[X\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\operatorname{GTGD}}Y\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\rho\\ \\bigl(Y=\\rho(X)\\bigr),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\in\\mathsf{GTGD}\">\\(X,Y\\in\\mathsf{GTGD}\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span> 是有限支撑变量双射。受保护 TGD 的变量改名只通过这种有限支撑双射完成；代换和 chase 触发使用该 alpha 等价代表，因此捕获避免改名不作为额外对象语言操作，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{freshNull}\">\\(\\operatorname{freshNull}\\)</span> 只生成 chase 新空值。</p>\n<p>替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathsf{Term}\">\\(\\theta:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathsf{Term}\\)</span> 扩张为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\theta(c)=c,\\quad \\widehat\\theta(\\nu)=\\nu,\\quad \\widehat\\theta(x)=\\theta(x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\theta(c)=c,\\quad \\widehat\\theta(\\nu)=\\nu,\\quad \\widehat\\theta(x)=\\theta(x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\theta(P(\\tau))=P(\\tau&#39;)\\quad\\text{其中 }\\tau&#39;(i)=\\widehat\\theta(\\tau(i)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\theta(P(\\tau))=P(\\tau&#39;)\\quad\\text{其中 }\\tau&#39;(i)=\\widehat\\theta(\\tau(i)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\theta(A_0,\\ldots,A_{k-1})=(\\theta(A_0),\\ldots,\\theta(A_{k-1})).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\theta(A_0,\\ldots,A_{k-1})=(\\theta(A_0),\\ldots,\\theta(A_{k-1})).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\theta(\\beta,\\eta)=(\\theta(\\beta),\\theta(\\eta)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\theta(\\beta,\\eta)=(\\theta(\\beta),\\theta(\\eta)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\beta,\\eta)\\in\\mathsf{GTGD}\">\\((\\beta,\\eta)\\in\\mathsf{GTGD}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta(\\beta,\\eta)\\in\\mathsf{GTGD}\">\\(\\theta(\\beta,\\eta)\\in\\mathsf{GTGD}\\)</span>：原保护原子的像仍覆盖替换后体内的全部变量。</p>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{GTGD}\n=\n\\{(\\widehat\\theta,\\theta_{\\mathsf{Atom}},\\theta_{\\mathsf{Conj}},\\theta_{\\mathsf{GTGD}}):\\theta:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathsf{Term}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{GTGD}\n=\n\\{(\\widehat\\theta,\\theta_{\\mathsf{Atom}},\\theta_{\\mathsf{Conj}},\\theta_{\\mathsf{GTGD}}):\\theta:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathsf{Term}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_{\\mathsf{Atom}}(P(\\tau))=\\theta(P(\\tau))\">\\(\\theta_{\\mathsf{Atom}}(P(\\tau))=\\theta(P(\\tau))\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_{\\mathsf{Conj}}(\\beta)=\\theta(\\beta)\">\\(\\theta_{\\mathsf{Conj}}(\\beta)=\\theta(\\beta)\\)</span>，且\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_{\\mathsf{GTGD}}(\\beta,\\eta)=\\theta(\\beta,\\eta)\">\\(\\theta_{\\mathsf{GTGD}}(\\beta,\\eta)=\\theta(\\beta,\\eta)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-同态与新空值\">5. 同态与新空值</h1>\n<p>对有限闭原子集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathsf{GAtom}\">\\(I\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathsf{GAtom}\\)</span>，定义空值集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Null}(I)=\\{\\nu\\in N_N:\\exists P(\\tau)\\in I\\ \\exists i&lt;\\operatorname{ar}(P)\\ \\tau(i)=\\nu\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Null}(I)=\\{\\nu\\in N_N:\\exists P(\\tau)\\in I\\ \\exists i&lt;\\operatorname{ar}(P)\\ \\tau(i)=\\nu\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>同态 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:\\beta\\to I\">\\(h:\\beta\\to I\\)</span> 是函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathsf{GTerm}\">\\(h:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathsf{GTerm}\\)</span>。它对项、原子和合取的作用由第 4 节替换条款给出，并满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rng}(h(\\beta))\\subseteq I.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{rng}(h(\\beta))\\subseteq I.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>新空值函数为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{freshNull}(X)=\\nu_m\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{freshNull}(X)=\\nu_m\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 为不在有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq N_N\">\\(X\\subseteq N_N\\)</span> 中出现的最小下标。</p>\n<h1 id=\"6.-追逐规则\">6. 追逐规则</h1>\n<p>实例集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Inst}=\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{GAtom})\">\\(\\mathsf{Inst}=\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{GAtom})\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>给定初始数据库 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathsf{GAtom}\">\\(D\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathsf{GAtom}\\)</span>，定义初始公理集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{GTGD}(D)=D.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{GTGD}(D)=D.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\beta,\\eta)\\in\\mathcal G\">\\((\\beta,\\eta)\\in\\mathcal G\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:\\beta\\to I\">\\(h:\\beta\\to I\\)</span>，令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Z=\\operatorname{FV}(\\eta)\\setminus\\operatorname{FV}(\\beta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Z=\\operatorname{FV}(\\eta)\\setminus\\operatorname{FV}(\\beta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span> 按变量下标升序写成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z=\\{z_0,\\ldots,z_{r-1}\\}\">\\(Z=\\{z_0,\\ldots,z_{r-1}\\}\\)</span>。扩展 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h^+:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathsf{GTerm}\">\\(h^+:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathsf{GTerm}\\)</span> 满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"h^+(x)=h(x)\\ (x\\in\\operatorname{FV}(\\beta)),\\qquad\nh^+(z_j)=\\operatorname{freshNull}(\\operatorname{Null}(I)\\cup\\{h^+(z_i):i&lt;j\\})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[h^+(x)=h(x)\\ (x\\in\\operatorname{FV}(\\beta)),\\qquad\nh^+(z_j)=\\operatorname{freshNull}(\\operatorname{Null}(I)\\cup\\{h^+(z_i):i&lt;j\\})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;r\">\\(j&lt;r\\)</span> 成立；若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(\\beta)\\cup Z\">\\(y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(\\beta)\\cup Z\\)</span>，则令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h^+(y)=h(y)\">\\(h^+(y)=h(y)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>定义程序载体与触发对象：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prog}_{GTGD}\n=\\{(\\Sigma,\\mathcal G):\\mathcal G\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathsf{GTGD}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Prog}_{GTGD}\n=\\{(\\Sigma,\\mathcal G):\\mathcal G\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathsf{GTGD}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Trig}_{G}(\\Pi)\n=\\{(I,\\beta,\\eta,h):I\\in\\mathsf{Inst},\\ (\\beta,\\eta)\\in\\mathcal G,\\ h:\\beta\\to I\\}\n\\quad(\\Pi=(\\Sigma,\\mathcal G)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Trig}_{G}(\\Pi)\n=\\{(I,\\beta,\\eta,h):I\\in\\mathsf{Inst},\\ (\\beta,\\eta)\\in\\mathcal G,\\ h:\\beta\\to I\\}\n\\quad(\\Pi=(\\Sigma,\\mathcal G)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{G}(\\Pi)\n=\\{((I),I\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(h^+(\\eta))):(I,\\beta,\\eta,h)\\in\\operatorname{Trig}_{G}(\\Pi)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{G}(\\Pi)\n=\\{((I),I\\cup\\operatorname{rng}(h^+(\\eta))):(I,\\beta,\\eta,h)\\in\\operatorname{Trig}_{G}(\\Pi)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-追逐证明\">7. 追逐证明</h1>\n<p>给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathsf{GAtom}\">\\(D\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathsf{GAtom}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi\\in\\mathsf{Prog}_{GTGD}\">\\(\\Pi\\in\\mathsf{Prog}_{GTGD}\\)</span>，guarded chase 证明是非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho=(I_0,\\ldots,I_{m-1})\">\\(\\rho=(I_0,\\ldots,I_{m-1})\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_0=D\">\\(I_0=D\\)</span>，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_i\\in\\mathsf{Inst}\">\\(I_i\\in\\mathsf{Inst}\\)</span>，且对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0&lt;i&lt;m\">\\(0&lt;i&lt;m\\)</span> 存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{G}(\\Pi)\">\\(((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{G}(\\Pi)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>定义证明谓词</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ChaseProof}_{G}(D,\\Pi,\\rho)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ChaseProof}_{G}(D,\\Pi,\\rho)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span> 满足上述条件。</p>\n<h1 id=\"8.-可导出关系\">8. 可导出关系</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D,\\Pi\\vdash_{\\operatorname{GTGD}}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D,\\Pi\\vdash_{\\operatorname{GTGD}}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho=(I_0,\\ldots,I_{m-1})\">\\(\\rho=(I_0,\\ldots,I_{m-1})\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ChaseProof}_{G}(D,\\Pi,\\rho)\">\\(\\operatorname{ChaseProof}_{G}(D,\\Pi,\\rho)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in I_{m-1}\">\\(A\\in I_{m-1}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"9.-可达闭包与-chase-后承\">9. 可达闭包与 chase 后承</h1>\n<p>定义知识库载体：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{KB}_{GTGD}\n=\n\\{(D,\\Pi):D\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathsf{GAtom},\\ \\Pi=(\\Sigma,\\mathcal G),\\ \\mathcal G\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathsf{GTGD}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{KB}_{GTGD}\n=\n\\{(D,\\Pi):D\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathsf{GAtom},\\ \\Pi=(\\Sigma,\\mathcal G),\\ \\mathcal G\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathsf{GTGD}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 chase 结构集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Str}_{GTGD}=\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Inst}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Str}_{GTGD}=\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Inst}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{GTGD}\">\\(X\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{GTGD}\\)</span> 定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Closed}_{G}(D,\\Pi,X)\">\\(\\operatorname{Closed}_{G}(D,\\Pi,X)\\)</span> 当且仅当：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in X\">\\(D\\in X\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I),J)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{G}(\\Pi)\">\\(((I),J)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{G}(\\Pi)\\)</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in X\">\\(I\\in X\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\\in X\">\\(J\\in X\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义可达闭包：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Reach}_{G}(D,\\Pi)=\\bigcap\\{X\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{GTGD}:\\operatorname{Closed}_{G}(D,\\Pi,X)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Reach}_{G}(D,\\Pi)=\\bigcap\\{X\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{GTGD}:\\operatorname{Closed}_{G}(D,\\Pi,X)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in\\mathsf{Inst}\">\\(I\\in\\mathsf{Inst}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{GAtom}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{GAtom}\\)</span> 定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"I\\models_{GTGD}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[I\\models_{GTGD}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\in I.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\in I.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>chase 后承定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D,\\Pi\\Vdash_{\\operatorname{GTGD}}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D,\\Pi\\Vdash_{\\operatorname{GTGD}}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in\\operatorname{Reach}_{G}(D,\\Pi)\">\\(I\\in\\operatorname{Reach}_{G}(D,\\Pi)\\)</span> 使</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"I\\models_{GTGD}A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[I\\models_{GTGD}A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"10.-特征差异\">10. 特征差异</h1>\n<p>Guarded TGDs 的目标差异对象：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\operatorname{GTGD}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\{(A,\\beta):\\operatorname{Guard}(A,\\beta)\\},\n\\{(\\beta,\\eta)\\in\\mathsf{GTGD}:\\exists A\\in\\operatorname{rng}(\\beta)\\ \\operatorname{Guard}(A,\\beta)\\},\n\\operatorname{Trig}_{G},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{G}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\operatorname{GTGD}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\{(A,\\beta):\\operatorname{Guard}(A,\\beta)\\},\n\\{(\\beta,\\eta)\\in\\mathsf{GTGD}:\\exists A\\in\\operatorname{rng}(\\beta)\\ \\operatorname{Guard}(A,\\beta)\\},\n\\operatorname{Trig}_{G},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{G}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>第一分量要求每条 TGD 的体内存在覆盖全部体变量的保护原子，即 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Guard}(A,\\beta)\">\\(\\operatorname{Guard}(A,\\beta)\\)</span> 对某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\operatorname{rng}(\\beta)\">\\(A\\in\\operatorname{rng}(\\beta)\\)</span> 成立。</p>\n<h1 id=\"11.-核心形式系统\">11. 核心形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S^{0}_{\\operatorname{GTGD}}=(\\Sigma,\\mathsf{Var},\\mathsf{Term},\\mathsf{GTerm},\\mathsf{Atom},\\mathsf{GAtom},\\mathsf{Conj},\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{BV}_{G},\\operatorname{Guard},\\mathsf{GuardPair},\\operatorname{gtgd},\\mathsf{GTGD},\\mathsf{Prog}_{GTGD},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\operatorname{GTGD}},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\operatorname{GTGD}},\\operatorname{Sub}_{GTGD},\\mathsf{Ax}_{GTGD},\\mathsf{Inst},\\operatorname{Trig}_{G},\\mathsf{Rule}_{G},\\operatorname{ChaseProof}_{G},\\vdash_{\\operatorname{GTGD}},\\mathsf{KB}_{GTGD},\\mathsf{Str}_{GTGD},\\operatorname{Reach}_{G},\\models_{GTGD},\\Vdash_{\\operatorname{GTGD}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S^{0}_{\\operatorname{GTGD}}=(\\Sigma,\\mathsf{Var},\\mathsf{Term},\\mathsf{GTerm},\\mathsf{Atom},\\mathsf{GAtom},\\mathsf{Conj},\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{BV}_{G},\\operatorname{Guard},\\mathsf{GuardPair},\\operatorname{gtgd},\\mathsf{GTGD},\\mathsf{Prog}_{GTGD},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\operatorname{GTGD}},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\operatorname{GTGD}},\\operatorname{Sub}_{GTGD},\\mathsf{Ax}_{GTGD},\\mathsf{Inst},\\operatorname{Trig}_{G},\\mathsf{Rule}_{G},\\operatorname{ChaseProof}_{G},\\vdash_{\\operatorname{GTGD}},\\mathsf{KB}_{GTGD},\\mathsf{Str}_{GTGD},\\operatorname{Reach}_{G},\\models_{GTGD},\\Vdash_{\\operatorname{GTGD}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该核心含 guarded TGD chase 推导与可达闭包后承；不含 EGD、负约束、非保护 TGD 或终止性定理。</p>\n<h1 id=\"12.-合取查询与-chase-答案证书\">12. 合取查询与 chase 答案证书</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{QVar}_{GTGD}=\\{z_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{QTerm}_{GTGD}=\\mathsf{GTerm}\\cup\\mathsf{QVar}_{GTGD},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{QVar}_{GTGD}=\\{z_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{QTerm}_{GTGD}=\\mathsf{GTerm}\\cup\\mathsf{QVar}_{GTGD},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{QVar}_{GTGD}\\cap\\mathsf{GTerm}=\\varnothing\">\\(\\mathsf{QVar}_{GTGD}\\cap\\mathsf{GTerm}=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{QAt}_{GTGD}\n=\n\\{P(\\tau):P\\in N_P,\\operatorname{ar}(P)=n,\\tau:n\\to\\mathsf{QTerm}_{GTGD}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{QAt}_{GTGD}\n=\n\\{P(\\tau):P\\in N_P,\\operatorname{ar}(P)=n,\\tau:n\\to\\mathsf{QTerm}_{GTGD}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CQ}_{GTGD}\n=\n\\{(\\bar z,\\Phi):k,n\\in\\mathbb N,\\bar z:k\\to\\mathsf{QVar}_{GTGD},\\Phi:n\\to\\mathsf{QAt}_{GTGD}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{CQ}_{GTGD}\n=\n\\{(\\bar z,\\Phi):k,n\\in\\mathbb N,\\bar z:k\\to\\mathsf{QVar}_{GTGD},\\Phi:n\\to\\mathsf{QAt}_{GTGD}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{QVal}_{GTGD}=\\{\\nu:\\mathsf{QVar}_{GTGD}\\to\\mathsf{GTerm}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{QVal}_{GTGD}=\\{\\nu:\\mathsf{QVar}_{GTGD}\\to\\mathsf{GTerm}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>查询项替换由</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{qsub}^{T}_{GTGD}:\\mathsf{QTerm}_{GTGD}\\times\\mathsf{QVal}_{GTGD}\\to\\mathsf{GTerm}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{qsub}^{T}_{GTGD}:\\mathsf{QTerm}_{GTGD}\\times\\mathsf{QVal}_{GTGD}\\to\\mathsf{GTerm}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>及下列条款给出：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{qsub}^{T}_{GTGD}(c,\\nu)=c\\ (c\\in N_C),\\quad\n\\operatorname{qsub}^{T}_{GTGD}(\\mu,\\nu)=\\mu\\ (\\mu\\in N_N),\\quad\n\\operatorname{qsub}^{T}_{GTGD}(z,\\nu)=\\nu(z)\\ (z\\in\\mathsf{QVar}_{GTGD})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{qsub}^{T}_{GTGD}(c,\\nu)=c\\ (c\\in N_C),\\quad\n\\operatorname{qsub}^{T}_{GTGD}(\\mu,\\nu)=\\mu\\ (\\mu\\in N_N),\\quad\n\\operatorname{qsub}^{T}_{GTGD}(z,\\nu)=\\nu(z)\\ (z\\in\\mathsf{QVar}_{GTGD})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=P(\\tau)\\in\\mathsf{QAt}_{GTGD}\">\\(A=P(\\tau)\\in\\mathsf{QAt}_{GTGD}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}(P)=n\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}(P)=n\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{qsub}_{GTGD}:\\mathsf{QAt}_{GTGD}\\times\\mathsf{QVal}_{GTGD}\\to\\mathsf{GAtom},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{qsub}_{GTGD}:\\mathsf{QAt}_{GTGD}\\times\\mathsf{QVal}_{GTGD}\\to\\mathsf{GAtom},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{qsub}_{GTGD}(A,\\nu)=P(\\tau&#39;),\n\\qquad\n\\tau&#39;(i)=\\operatorname{qsub}^{T}_{GTGD}(\\tau(i),\\nu)\\quad(i&lt;n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{qsub}_{GTGD}(A,\\nu)=P(\\tau&#39;),\n\\qquad\n\\tau&#39;(i)=\\operatorname{qsub}^{T}_{GTGD}(\\tau(i),\\nu)\\quad(i&lt;n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q=(\\bar z,\\Phi)\\in\\mathsf{CQ}_{GTGD}\">\\(q=(\\bar z,\\Phi)\\in\\mathsf{CQ}_{GTGD}\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{QCert}_{GTGD}(D,\\Pi,q,\\nu,\\rho)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{QCert}_{GTGD}(D,\\Pi,q,\\nu,\\rho)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\\in\\mathsf{QVal}_{GTGD}\">\\(\\nu\\in\\mathsf{QVal}_{GTGD}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ChaseProof}_{G}(D,\\Pi,\\rho)\">\\(\\operatorname{ChaseProof}_{G}(D,\\Pi,\\rho)\\)</span>，并且若\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho=(I_0,\\ldots,I_{m-1})\">\\(\\rho=(I_0,\\ldots,I_{m-1})\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi:n\\to\\mathsf{QAt}_{GTGD}\">\\(\\Phi:n\\to\\mathsf{QAt}_{GTGD}\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall i&lt;n\\ (\\operatorname{qsub}_{GTGD}(\\Phi(i),\\nu)\\in I_{m-1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall i&lt;n\\ (\\operatorname{qsub}_{GTGD}(\\Phi(i),\\nu)\\in I_{m-1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>查询答案为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ans}_{GTGD}(D,\\Pi,q)\n=\n\\{\\nu\\circ\\bar z:\\exists\\rho\\ \\operatorname{QCert}_{GTGD}(D,\\Pi,q,\\nu,\\rho)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ans}_{GTGD}(D,\\Pi,q)\n=\n\\{\\nu\\circ\\bar z:\\exists\\rho\\ \\operatorname{QCert}_{GTGD}(D,\\Pi,q,\\nu,\\rho)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"13.-整个形式系统\">13. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{\\operatorname{GTGD}}\n=\n(\\mathcal S^{0}_{\\operatorname{GTGD}},\\mathsf{QVar}_{GTGD},\\mathsf{QTerm}_{GTGD},\n\\mathsf{QAt}_{GTGD},\\mathsf{CQ}_{GTGD},\\mathsf{QVal}_{GTGD},\n\\operatorname{qsub}^{T}_{GTGD},\\operatorname{qsub}_{GTGD},\n\\operatorname{QCert}_{GTGD},\\operatorname{Ans}_{GTGD}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{\\operatorname{GTGD}}\n=\n(\\mathcal S^{0}_{\\operatorname{GTGD}},\\mathsf{QVar}_{GTGD},\\mathsf{QTerm}_{GTGD},\n\\mathsf{QAt}_{GTGD},\\mathsf{CQ}_{GTGD},\\mathsf{QVal}_{GTGD},\n\\operatorname{qsub}^{T}_{GTGD},\\operatorname{qsub}_{GTGD},\n\\operatorname{QCert}_{GTGD},\\operatorname{Ans}_{GTGD}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统含 guarded TGD 合取查询、有限 guarded chase 证书和查询答案关系；不含 EGD、负约束、非保护 TGD 或终止性定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"762-Guarded-TGDs","text":"762 Guarded TGDs","level":1},{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-项、原子与合取","text":"2. 项、原子与合取","level":1},{"id":"3.-Guarded-TGD","text":"3. Guarded TGD","level":1},{"id":"4.-替换","text":"4. 替换","level":1},{"id":"5.-同态与新空值","text":"5. 同态与新空值","level":1},{"id":"6.-追逐规则","text":"6. 追逐规则","level":1},{"id":"7